WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:00.667
The

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:05.405
road to the White House starts in Iowa

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.442
and New

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.878
for former Vice President Mike Pence.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:14.280
The early stretch of his race

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.317
has been a jog

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:17.584
through a

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:20.120
two mile July 4th parade in Urbandale

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:22.922
and chocolate chip

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.624
eating the local sweets in Rule

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:25.692
Northwest Iowa.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:26.659
It's a serious issue.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:27.727
One way to deal with them

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.362
repairing the personal politics

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.931
of local Republicans is wonderful.

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:32.599
It's the only way

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.434
you have a chance to really know

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:35.101
how they feel

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.102
and answer questions

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:38.338
at your level of the community.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.839
Awesome.

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.742
Ten counties sweep for candidate Pence

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:43.977
just this week

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:44.577
as he aims

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:47.347
to hit all 99 counties in Iowa.

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:48.181
What is it

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:49.215
that you hope to achieve

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.517
by visiting all these counties,

00:00:50.517 --> 00:00:52.185
by doing all of these parades?

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:52.419
You know,

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:53.420
I came to a conclusion

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.387
over the last few years

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:57.090
that I'm I'm well known, but

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.391
we're not known well,

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:00.060
we're going to be able to

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:00.894
take our story,

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:01.661
take our case,

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:03.096
and take our whole record,

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:04.064
the story of our family

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:06.800
to the people of Iowa, to great success.

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:08.268
The Midwest Native plans

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:11.905
to deliver it over prayer and pizza.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.574
Pence's preferred spot for a slice,

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:15.775
the Pizza Ranch,

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:18.311
a chain with 71 locations across Iowa.

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:20.080
If you want to win the Iowa caucus,

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:20.647
it's a

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:23.016
it's a 50 person Pizza Ranch meeting

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.752
because everybody that came here tonight

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:26.186
I guarantee

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:27.587
the one thing they have in common

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:28.922
they're all going to caucus.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.557
Pence National Campaign Chair Chip

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:33.026
Saltsman hatched the so-called Pizza

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:35.562
Ranch strategy in 2008

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.764
as campaign manager for then Republican

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.432
presidential hopeful Mike Huckabee,

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:43.336
who would come from behind

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:46.706
and win the 2008 Iowa caucuses.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.475
This room believes

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:49.442
Pence's campaign

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:52.045
is how he, too, could win here.

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:53.113
You're looking for people

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:54.180
that are willing to come out

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.014
on a cold night.

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:55.748
I spent an hour

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:56.616
and a half

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.251
listening to everybody else talk

00:01:58.251 --> 00:01:59.652
and then vote for your person.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:00.420
And the way you build

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.754
those relationships

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:03.523
are in meetings of 50,

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:05.191
not rallies of 5000.

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.092
In this Pizza

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:07.227
Ranch meeting of 50

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:09.095
Iowans some wearing their allegiance

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:11.664
to a different Republican candidate,

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:12.866
Pence takes

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:14.968
any and all questions from voters,

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:15.902
including one

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:17.637
who confronted him about his role

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:18.404
in certifying

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:21.207
the 2020 election results on January 6th.

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:24.511
Who won that election?

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:27.247
In history?

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:30.083
This one I want to tell you,

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.017
with all due respect,

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:31.751
I said before

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:32.619
I said when I announced

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:34.754
President Trump was wrong

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:36.256
about my authority, that

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:36.956
he's still wrong.

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.393
I believe it with all my heart.

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:41.394
That answer

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:43.763
only slightly moved Lujan Bertrand,

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:45.231
who asked the question.

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:48.568
I really do feel like he altered history.

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:50.670
Would you consider supporting Mr.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.839
Pence after listening to him?

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:55.441
I would consider it,

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:57.443
but he has that one hiccup.

00:02:57.443 --> 00:02:59.746
But meeting Pence did change

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:01.447
Amy Klein's mind.

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:02.982
Well, I voted for Mr.

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:04.584
Trump before.

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:05.151
I know

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:09.722
that I've been going to all of the people

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:12.392
that come that want to run for president.

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:14.661
And so far, I like him the best.

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:16.996
So your opinion has changed

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:18.264
after seeing him up close

